1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,080
The sandbag is ready.

3
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:37,200
It will warm you and drive out the chill.

4
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,360
Let me apply it for you, Director.

5
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,080
I can do it myself.

6
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,160
Director Meng.

7
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,160
Now that you're the Empress-designate,

8
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,320
does that mean from now on

9
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,000
we should deliberately keep our distance?

10
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,960
That isn't what I meant.

11
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,200
What's gotten into you lately?

12
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,200
I was just thinking

13
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,840
how quickly everything can change.

14
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,040
The Office of Public Inquiry...

15
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,920
Is it going to be dissolved?

16
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,440
Look.

17
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,640
Just look at all these gifts they sent.

18
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,560
Aren't they wonderful?

19
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,080
Let's see which of those gossips outside

20
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:29,160
still dares say a word against our lady.

21
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,200
We owe it to the Second Young Master

22
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:33,040
for standing by us when we needed him.

23
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,000
You're still calling
him Second Young Master?

24
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,000
You should call him Son-in-law now.

25
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,760
But come to think of it,

26
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,040
I could tell long ago

27
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,880
that our new son-in-law
had feelings for her.

28
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,040
-Madam.
-Madam.

29
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,600
Today's the bride's homecoming banquet.

30
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,040
Go fetch the master of the house.

31
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,440
Tell him to stop fussing over the cooking.

32
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,640
-Yes, Madam.
-Yes, Madam.

33
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,680
Come, Anian.

34
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,320
Now that Zhili has married you,

35
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,640
there are some things I must say.

36
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,440
Whatever happened before,

37
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:13,600
from now on, you must support each other

38
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,840
and cherish the bond you now share.

39
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:16,800
Don't worry, Father.

40
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,040
I will treasure Zhili above all else

41
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,720
and never let her suffer
the slightest harm.

42
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,800
Good.

43
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,840
Zhili.

44
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,960
Anian may always give way to you,

45
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,520
but now that you've
married into the Di family,

46
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:39,280
you mustn't be as willful
as you were at home

47
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,200
or bully Anian.

48
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,280
I may dote on you,

49
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,680
but I'll stand up for Anian too.

50
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,480
Father.

51
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,600
I will be a good daughter-in-law
to the Di family.

52
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,520
Good.

53
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,520
Zhili.

54
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:58,520
Anian is Marquis Wu's only son.

55
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:01,400
If you can give the Di family heirs soon,

56
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:03,240
then our Shen family

57
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:05,320
we can answer to Marquis Wu's spirit

58
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,720
with a clear conscience.

59
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,680
Father, Zhili loves

60
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,280
your sweet-and-sour ribs most.

61
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,600
When you have time, you must teach me.

62
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,080
Then I can make them for Zhili.

63
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,480
I should have taught you long ago.

64
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,280
If Zhishu heard me say that,

65
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,760
that rascal

66
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,800
would get jealous and compete with you

67
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,320
over who loves Zhili more.

68
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,920
Zhishu always has to join the fun.

69
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,840
You don't know the half of it.

70
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,680
They used to fight over a single rib,

71
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,600
those two siblings,

72
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,400
until their chopsticks became weapons.

73
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,760
But now,

74
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,320
with a husband protecting her,

75
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,320
that rascal won't get
a chance to snatch one.

76
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,160
Brother still hasn't returned.

77
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:47,480
He even missed my wedding to Anian,

78
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,160
and hasn't sent a single letter home.

79
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,840
Your brother is carrying
out an imperial mission.

80
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,360
He can't leave his post for now.

81
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,360
When he returns,

82
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,720
we'll all have a proper reunion.

83
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,200
Come, Father.

84
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:58,240
To our reunion.

85
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,440
Come.

86
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,960
Father.

87
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,280
Is your chest hurting
again? Get his medicine!

88
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:10,800
It's all right.

89
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,320
I'm fine.

90
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,520
It's an old complaint.

91
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,320
It's almost funny.

92
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,520
In the past,

93
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:21,280
that rascal always made
my chest ache with anger.

94
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,320
And now,

95
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,360
I can't even blame him for it.

96
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,720
Your Majesty...

97
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,360
Your Majesty!

98
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:50,080
Your Majesty!

99
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,440
An urgent express dispatch from Qingzhou!

100
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,000
Your Majesty...

101
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,720
You rotten boy!

102
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,000
Come out here!

103
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,560
I want to speak to you face-to-face!

104
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:43,480
Zhishu...

105
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,440
While carrying out his orders,

106
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,120
he encountered danger.

107
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,160
Come out here!

108
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,320
Come out!

109
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,840
I serve with the Qingzhou garrison.

110
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,080
By General Huo's order,

111
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,720
we have escorted Young Lord Shen

112
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,920
home.

113
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:11,320
You...

114
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,880
You must have made a mistake.

115
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,400
Zhishu would never...

116
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,840
leave without a word

117
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,680
and abandon all of us.

118
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,440
Zhishu.

119
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,200
My son...

120
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,440
Zhishu!

121
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,720
My son...

122
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:40,280
-Father!
-Father!

123
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,320
You said that on my birthday,

124
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,520
you'd give me that half
of the bronze tally.

125
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,520
By my reckoning,

126
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,720
I won't be back in time.

127
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,560
Can't I have my birthday gift early?

128
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:56,680
What I said was:

129
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:59,960
when you can truly stand on your own

130
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,600
and shoulder the Shen
family's duty as a minister,

131
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:05,080
then you may ask for the
half of the tiger-head tally.

132
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,880
Father!

133
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,680
You're far too stingy.

134
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,800
I've begged you for that
half-tally for three years.

135
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:12,720
If you still won't give it to me,

136
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,320
-I'll trade my half for wine tomorrow.
-You dare!

137
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,840
You insolent boy!

138
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,880
Father, once I've sold it for wine,

139
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,120
I'll bring you back the
finest jar money can buy.

140
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,280
Before he left,

141
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:28,040
he proudly told me

142
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:31,400
he had been appointed
a fourth-rank Censor.

143
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,440
He even asked me for his birthday gift.

144
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,880
I was afraid he would grow conceited,

145
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,640
so I scolded him.

146
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:48,640
If I'd known it would be
the last time I saw him,

147
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:54,560
this bronze tally...

148
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:59,320
would have reached his hands.

149
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,480
Zhishu said

150
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,400
that as soon as he returned,
he'd arrange the wedding

151
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,080
and marry me.

152
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,480
Miss Yan.

153
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:25,000
This is your birth-date card.

154
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:26,800
Please take it back.

155
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:41,640
Before he left, Zhishu
wrote the marriage contract

156
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,040
and prepared the betrothal gift list.

157
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:46,680
He begged me to prepare the three marriage
documents and six betrothal gifts,

158
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:48,520
so when he returned,

159
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,840
he could marry you with full honor.

160
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:06,080
I'd like to see who dares
lay a hand on her today.

161
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,640
Fuzhi, I'm sorry I'm late.

162
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:12,280
If I, Shen Zhishu, am to marry,

163
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,640
not one of the Six Rites may be omitted,

164
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,160
and all three marriage
documents must be prepared.

165
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,000
When the auspicious day comes,

166
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,240
I will send a grand bridal sedan

167
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:22,240
and welcome Fuzhi into
the Shen family in honor.

168
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,680
I don't believe Young Lord Shen,

169
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:26,240
surrounded by all the noble
ladies of the capital,

170
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:29,480
would truly give up
that garden of beauties

171
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,880
for a merchant's daughter like me

172
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,360
and bind his heart to mine

173
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,800
for the rest of his life.

174
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,280
What if I cut down every peach blossom?

175
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,960
Then...

176
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,800
clear away every last
flower and weed around you,

177
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:41,880
every one of them,

178
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,600
and ask me again.

179
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,480
I promise you,

180
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,600
if I ever chase another woman again,

181
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:49,560
you may leave me without another word.

182
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,200
Wait for me to come back.

183
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:20,160
Zhishu and I never bowed
before Heaven and Earth,

184
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,880
but in my heart, I already chose him.

185
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,160
If you will accept me,

186
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,520
I wish to be a daughter-in-law
of the Shen family.

187
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,920
Silly child.

188
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,480
You're still in the bloom of youth.

189
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:37,480
Don't sacrifice your whole future.

190
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:39,360
-Please, get up.
-My mind is made up.

191
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:41,720
Unless...

192
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:47,040
you truly cannot accept me.

193
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,600
Only today do I understand

194
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:58,120
why Zhishu gave his heart to you.

195
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:01,160
To have you love him so sincerely

196
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,880
was my son's good fortune.

197
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,280
Good child.

198
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,600
Please, get up.

199
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,760
Good child.

200
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,120
From now on, we're one family.

201
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,520
One family.

202
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,640
Father.

203
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:23,840
Mother.

204
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,720
Rest assured, Director Meng.

205
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:41,720
This medicine will let Miss
Yan sleep for a full day.

206
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:43,640
She hasn't closed her
eyes the entire journey.

207
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,680
A little calming tea was the only way

208
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:47,960
to make her get some proper rest.

209
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,480
Lord Meng.

210
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:54,320
Manager Yan...

211
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:55,840
How is she?

212
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,000
What kind of question is that?

213
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:00,160
Just thinking that we'll never
see Young Lord Shen again

214
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,080
makes my heart ache.

215
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,240
Imagine how the manager must feel.

216
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,480
Only last month, Young Lord Shen

217
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,160
helped us finish blending a new wine.

218
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:08,640
He said he'd taste it when he came back.

219
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,960
What monster did this to him?

220
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,280
Young Lord Shen

221
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:15,000
was one of us at the Office too.

222
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:18,560
I won't let his death go unanswered.

223
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,280
And I won't let you

224
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,240
spend every day drowning in tears.

225
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,560
Your Majesty.

226
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:53,440
Your wounds from the whip haven't healed.

227
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:54,520
You mustn't keep practicing.

228
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,640
If they split open again,

229
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,880
how could this old servant
answer to the late Emperor?

230
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,280
I'm wounded,

231
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,880
not dying.

232
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:12,640
Chief Steward You.

233
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,160
Let me.

234
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,560
Director Meng.

235
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:18,960
Please talk some sense into His Majesty.

236
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:20,560
Not only is he practicing
swordplay while wounded,

237
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,840
he hasn't eaten a thing all day.

238
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:38,160
I know Your Majesty is grieving.

239
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:42,280
I am willing to avenge Young Lord Shen.

240
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,320
If you discovered

241
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,320
that someone you knew was
in the Blood Moon Society,

242
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,360
what would you do?

243
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,480
Your Majesty, rest assured.

244
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,440
Though Situ Xue and I get along well,

245
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:56,960
I know where to draw the line.

246
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:59,200
If the Blood Moon Society
harms Daning's people,

247
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,640
I will show them no mercy.

248
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:03,320
Your Majesty's wounds haven't healed yet.

249
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:05,800
Let me apply the medicine.

250
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:16,040
Your Highness, it is past midnight.

251
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:18,240
Our contact still hasn't arrived.

252
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,240
Something may have gone wrong.

253
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:20,800
Wait a little longer.

254
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:22,080
Your Highness.

255
00:15:22,160 --> 00:15:24,000
The Blood Moon Society cannot be trusted.

256
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,480
Last time, they not only broke their word,

257
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,280
they even killed our secret envoy.

258
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,440
Can you truly trust people

259
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,600
who change their word so easily?

260
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:34,200
Last time, everything
happened too suddenly.

261
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:36,680
I've always suspected
there was more to it.

262
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:39,520
I must negotiate with the Blood
Moon Society in person again.

263
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,680
But the First Prince

264
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:42,360
strongly favors a policy of conciliation.

265
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,160
This time,

266
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,000
if Your Highness contacts
the Blood Moon Society,

267
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:46,920
I fear...

268
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:49,040
My elder brother

269
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,400
is indecisive

270
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,840
and hopelessly naive.

271
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:54,120
Does he truly think one marriage pact

272
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:55,560
can buy lasting peace?

273
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,800
When Ying Gua rejected
the marriage alliance,

274
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,680
Beijian's honor

275
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:01,320
was already trampled underfoot.

276
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:04,440
A wolf does not wag its tail and beg.

277
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:07,040
Only a dog does.

278
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,800
For the past two years, Daning

279
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:10,360
has poured troops into the border,

280
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,600
stockpiling grain and
building fortifications.

281
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,040
They may well be planning

282
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,240
to trap us in the northern
desert until we die.

283
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,400
This time, I will make Daning

284
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:18,440
see for itself

285
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:20,920
what Beijian's iron cavalry truly means.

286
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,840
And I will prove to Father

287
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,720
that the world

288
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,960
is not won by kneeling and begging,

289
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:30,680
but by fighting for it
with sword and steel.

290
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:32,720
Your Highness, someone's coming.

291
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:20,600
Sir.

292
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:23,840
I've cleared up the misunderstanding
with Beijian's Second Prince

293
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:26,040
and confirmed someone did
impersonate our Society

294
00:17:26,120 --> 00:17:27,040
to sabotage the alliance.

295
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,040
The Second Prince of Beijian

296
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:30,200
has agreed to join forces with us

297
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:31,360
and continue the war against Daning.

298
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:34,200
Their blood will not
have been shed in vain.

299
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:37,120
Daning's blood debt

300
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:40,880
must be repaid with mountains
of corpses and seas of blood.

301
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:49,880
Daning's court is in turmoil now.

302
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,640
Our Princess

303
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:53,280
is about to rise to the pinnacle of power.

304
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:56,400
Once her bloodline memories awaken,

305
00:17:56,880 --> 00:18:00,320
we will welcome the Princess at once

306
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,920
and restore our realm.

307
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:05,280
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

308
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:08,160
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

309
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:10,800
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

310
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:14,280
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

311
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:04,240
Grand Tutor!

312
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:06,840
The Young Master's spirit has returned!

313
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:27,480
Father.

314
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,000
Mother.

315
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:30,840
I'm home.

316
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,000
Brother!

317
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:47,120
Brother!

318
00:19:58,040 --> 00:19:59,200
Your unfilial son

319
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:01,480
has made you worry.

320
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,600
My son...

321
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:09,960
You're home. That's all that matters.

322
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:11,720
That's all that matters.

323
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,120
My husband...

324
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:24,600
Fuzhi.

325
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,400
Shen Zhishu!

326
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:49,560
You've gone too far!

327
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:52,320
Do you know how many paper
offerings I burned for you?

328
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:55,240
Do you know how heartbroken I was?

329
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:59,360
How could you joke about life and death?

330
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:14,560
Let me see.

331
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,000
It'll frighten you.

332
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:36,680
Father.

333
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:38,480
Are you...

334
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,080
disappointed in me?

335
00:21:41,800 --> 00:21:42,880
All your life, Father,

336
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:44,400
you've achieved great things.

337
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:47,520
I'm afraid I may never equal you.

338
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:50,840
The only thing I had that could compare

339
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:53,080
was this face of mine.

340
00:21:54,800 --> 00:21:56,600
Now I've lost even that advantage.

341
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:03,520
You are the eldest son of the Shen family.

342
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:06,600
You grew up studying beside His Majesty.

343
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:08,160
At twenty,

344
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:10,520
you could enter officialdom
through family privilege.

345
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:14,080
Compared with scholars
born to humble families,

346
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,920
you have been extraordinarily fortunate.

347
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:18,600
But with the honor of such a family name,

348
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:21,280
you must possess civil talent

349
00:22:21,360 --> 00:22:22,800
as well as martial skill.

350
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:25,560
As His Majesty's trusted friend,

351
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:28,680
you must never openly hunger for power,

352
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:30,640
but neither can you be
wholly without ambition.

353
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:32,400
More importantly,

354
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:34,160
on your shoulders rests

355
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:35,880
the entire Shen clan

356
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:38,160
and the duty to carry its honor forward.

357
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:43,400
I demanded so much of you

358
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:46,440
because I feared one achievement
would make you complacent.

359
00:22:46,520 --> 00:22:47,600
That is why I...

360
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:52,040
why I kept putting you down.

361
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,360
After hearing what happened to you,

362
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:01,040
there was something I kept wanting to say.

363
00:23:04,800 --> 00:23:07,080
You are the pride of the Shen family.

364
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,280
I was wrong.

365
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,480
I never thought

366
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:24,320
I'd hear the words "I was wrong"
from a stubborn old man like you.

367
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:28,320
If I'd come back half a month later,

368
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:30,600
would you have handed the
whole Shen family over to me?

369
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:32,120
You little...

370
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:36,040
You little rascal.

371
00:23:38,560 --> 00:23:39,480
That must hurt terribly.

372
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,920
Compared with the beatings
Father gave me as a boy,

373
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,160
this is nothing.

374
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:03,920
Though I was wounded,
misfortune brought a blessing.

375
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,800
I was carrying the Blood
Moon Society's scepter

376
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:08,440
when members of the
Society found and saved me.

377
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:10,800
While recovering among them,

378
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:12,240
I learned something important.

379
00:24:12,320 --> 00:24:14,000
Mr. Shangguan of the Blood Moon Society

380
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:14,960
is not only alive,

381
00:24:15,040 --> 00:24:16,720
he is hiding among the officials at court.

382
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,480
I should have known.

383
00:24:21,080 --> 00:24:22,560
A man like him would never die so easily.

384
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:24,960
Your Majesty, shall we investigate
the entire court at once?

385
00:24:25,960 --> 00:24:28,160
If we mishandle this, the
ministers will turn on each other.

386
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:30,960
Then if the Blood Moon Society
and Beijian strike together,

387
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,800
we'll face enemies within and without.

388
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:34,720
But the marriage proposal
from Beijian's First Prince

389
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:36,720
clearly shows he broke with
the Blood Moon Society first.

390
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:39,600
Mr. Shangguan is colluding
with the Second Prince.

391
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:41,440
Most likely.

392
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:43,800
I've heard the Second Prince has never
gotten along with his elder brother.

393
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:45,800
And compared with the First Prince,

394
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:47,200
he is far more warlike.

395
00:24:47,280 --> 00:24:49,760
His intentions are hard to fathom.
We cannot let our guard down.

396
00:24:49,840 --> 00:24:51,000
Whatever happens,

397
00:24:51,080 --> 00:24:52,120
if Your Majesty rejects
this marriage alliance,

398
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:53,880
war on the frontier may be unavoidable.

399
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:55,400
What inch of this realm

400
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:57,440
was not won by sword and cavalry?

401
00:24:58,200 --> 00:24:59,200
Beijian has a wolf's nature.

402
00:24:59,280 --> 00:25:00,640
Whichever prince it is,

403
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:02,440
if he can secretly collude
with the Blood Moon Society,

404
00:25:02,520 --> 00:25:04,040
why would he keep his word later?

405
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,360
This marriage proposal

406
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:08,240
only proves they fear
our frontier cavalry.

407
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:11,120
The misunderstanding between
Beijian and the Blood Moon Society

408
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,800
will be exposed sooner or later.

409
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:14,040
My father once said

410
00:25:14,120 --> 00:25:16,120
Beijian is ravenous and
deceitful, full of schemes.

411
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,560
I am ready to go to war at any time.

412
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:20,120
But before that,

413
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:21,480
we must find Shangguan.

414
00:25:21,560 --> 00:25:22,960
I suspect Shangguan

415
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:26,400
is someone close to us.

416
00:25:29,520 --> 00:25:31,880
When Your Majesty first
ascended the throne,

417
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:33,440
I had not yet entered the court.

418
00:25:33,520 --> 00:25:36,320
Yet I boldly asked for a post
at the Office of Public Inquiry

419
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:40,120
and was even rebuked by Your Majesty.

420
00:25:43,680 --> 00:25:45,280
I still remember looking at you then,

421
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:47,360
so outrageously bold,

422
00:25:48,040 --> 00:25:49,640
and knowing no one but you

423
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:50,680
could lead the Office of Public Inquiry.

424
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:52,720
And now,

425
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:56,160
you've fulfilled every word you said then.

426
00:25:57,200 --> 00:25:58,560
In fact, you've done

427
00:26:00,600 --> 00:26:01,440
even better than I expected.

428
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:06,440
When I entered the court,
I had no attachments.

429
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:09,080
Only Fuzhi was someone I worried about.

430
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:11,720
That was why I never hesitated.

431
00:26:12,600 --> 00:26:14,760
Exhuming bodies, investigating cases,

432
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:15,960
pursuing Ling Yunfei...

433
00:26:16,040 --> 00:26:18,080
I never once faltered.

434
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,560
But now,

435
00:26:20,560 --> 00:26:22,240
there are more people I want to protect.

436
00:26:23,360 --> 00:26:24,960
So I've learned what fear is.

437
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:29,000
We're both afraid of losing those we love.

438
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:31,280
These past days,

439
00:26:31,360 --> 00:26:32,640
I have watched helplessly

440
00:26:32,720 --> 00:26:35,240
as one person after another
close to me was taken away.

441
00:26:40,280 --> 00:26:41,400
What happened to Zhishu

442
00:26:44,520 --> 00:26:46,200
has made me more afraid than ever.

443
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:14,360
I may possess this entire realm,

444
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:18,160
yet perhaps I still can't
keep the people I treasure.

445
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:27,320
I won't leave Your Majesty.

446
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:30,160
I want to remain at the
Office of Public Inquiry

447
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:31,280
and continue serving you.

448
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:43,640
Meng Tinghui.

449
00:27:45,280 --> 00:27:46,720
Let's get married.

450
00:27:49,320 --> 00:27:51,480
The court is settled now.

451
00:27:51,560 --> 00:27:53,000
No one can stand in our way anymore.

452
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:55,560
This hairpin...

453
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:57,520
I spent three months making it myself.

454
00:27:57,600 --> 00:27:59,440
I've waited to place it in
your hair and crown you,

455
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:00,920
then proclaim you to the entire realm.

456
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,040
Your Majesty.

457
00:28:06,920 --> 00:28:07,960
Right now,

458
00:28:08,800 --> 00:28:10,040
I cannot marry you.

459
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:11,840
Why?

460
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:13,080
Your Majesty knows me.

461
00:28:14,520 --> 00:28:15,840
Everything I've fought for

462
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:19,120
was to root out entrenched abuses
throughout the court and government.

463
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:20,880
The Blood Moon Society seeks

464
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:22,800
to overthrow Daning itself.

465
00:28:22,880 --> 00:28:24,800
What frightens me even more

466
00:28:25,320 --> 00:28:27,280
is that Shangguan is
hidden within the court.

467
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:29,640
So I beg Your Majesty

468
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:32,240
to let me investigate the
Blood Moon Society thoroughly.

469
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:33,200
Ask me for anything else.

470
00:28:33,280 --> 00:28:34,640
But not the Blood Moon Society.

471
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:37,200
I have given the Blood Moon Society case

472
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:39,160
entirely to Zhishu.

473
00:28:39,240 --> 00:28:41,280
Your Majesty is hiding something from me.

474
00:28:43,360 --> 00:28:44,920
I once asked Your Majesty

475
00:28:45,760 --> 00:28:47,560
whether we had truly opened
our hearts to each other.

476
00:28:48,440 --> 00:28:49,400
So it turns out...

477
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:51,800
we haven't.

478
00:28:52,840 --> 00:28:54,200
The burden of the realm is immense.

479
00:28:54,800 --> 00:28:56,040
The palace has depths upon depths.

480
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,600
Even to you,

481
00:29:00,760 --> 00:29:03,360
I cannot lay every
secret of my heart bare.

482
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:10,360
I will take my leave.

483
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:38,240
Shen Zhishu!

484
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:40,680
How long are you going to hide from me?

485
00:29:42,800 --> 00:29:43,960
Fuzhi.

486
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:45,000
We should part.

487
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:49,560
Don't come looking for me again.

488
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:56,160
Part?

489
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:03,560
What about the marriage
contract you wrote yourself?

490
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,360
Are you taking it back?

491
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:13,480
I failed to keep our promise.

492
00:30:15,080 --> 00:30:16,720
I came back scarred.

493
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:18,480
Even my face...

494
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:20,640
It's only a scar.

495
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:23,240
A real man can weather far worse.

496
00:30:23,320 --> 00:30:24,680
What's the big deal?

497
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:32,600
I think

498
00:30:33,280 --> 00:30:34,680
that scar

499
00:30:35,280 --> 00:30:36,760
makes you look even more gallant.

500
00:30:37,320 --> 00:30:38,480
I'm serious.

501
00:30:38,560 --> 00:30:39,760
As a minister,

502
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:42,240
I gave up any fear of death long ago.

503
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:47,280
Daning now faces dangers
within and without.

504
00:30:47,360 --> 00:30:49,320
The Shen clan bears a heavy duty.

505
00:30:51,080 --> 00:30:52,840
The next time I carry out an assignment,

506
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:54,320
I may suffer far worse than a wound.

507
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:20,120
Then I'll wait for you to come back.

508
00:31:21,640 --> 00:31:22,720
And if you never do,

509
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:25,200
I'll wait for you for the rest of my life.

510
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,840
I loved the flirtatious young lord

511
00:31:32,120 --> 00:31:34,920
who once drunkenly picked flowers for me.

512
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,400
Of course I did.

513
00:31:41,120 --> 00:31:42,280
But now,

514
00:31:42,760 --> 00:31:45,680
this brave man with a scar on his face

515
00:31:46,840 --> 00:31:48,200
makes my heart ache even more

516
00:31:52,040 --> 00:31:53,600
and is worth loving for a lifetime.

517
00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:22,800
Mengmeng.

518
00:32:22,880 --> 00:32:23,840
His Majesty truly

519
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:25,480
treats you wonderfully.

520
00:32:25,560 --> 00:32:27,800
He even granted you this
imperial hot spring.

521
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:29,080
And that's not even mentioning

522
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:30,840
how he overturned ancestral law for you.

523
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:32,560
That shook the entire realm.

524
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:34,000
Who wouldn't envy you?

525
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:37,480
When did you become his advocate?

526
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:45,320
Now even my closest friend

527
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:46,640
has been won over by him.

528
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:48,720
It seems behind my back,

529
00:32:48,800 --> 00:32:50,720
I truly have no one left.

530
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:54,320
Dear Mengmeng.

531
00:32:56,400 --> 00:32:58,600
Whatever happens in the future,

532
00:32:58,680 --> 00:33:00,160
I will always stand behind you.

533
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:03,520
What matters to me isn't
some grand principle.

534
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:05,200
It's you.

535
00:33:05,840 --> 00:33:07,160
It's just that

536
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:08,880
I truly think there is
no one in this world

537
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:10,280
worthy of standing beside you

538
00:33:10,360 --> 00:33:11,440
except His Majesty.

539
00:33:13,240 --> 00:33:15,000
I've seen how hard

540
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:16,600
you've fought to come this far.

541
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:19,200
That's why I still wish

542
00:33:19,280 --> 00:33:21,480
there were someone powerful
enough to protect you.

543
00:33:22,320 --> 00:33:23,160
Fuzhi.

544
00:33:24,800 --> 00:33:26,000
Marrying His Majesty

545
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:29,320
means placing myself under
countless watching eyes

546
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:31,480
and accusing fingers.

547
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:36,240
If I become Empress,

548
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:39,040
even one extra word with him

549
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,280
would have the entire court saying

550
00:33:41,360 --> 00:33:43,560
the Empress is meddling in state affairs.

551
00:33:44,520 --> 00:33:46,920
I don't want the glory of an
Empress's crown and robes.

552
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:50,440
I want to stand openly
and honorably in court.

553
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:53,840
I want him to become a
wise ruler for the ages.

554
00:33:55,040 --> 00:33:57,560
But I won't sacrifice half
a lifetime of ambition

555
00:33:58,080 --> 00:33:59,520
to be confined behind the Empress's seal.

556
00:34:02,120 --> 00:34:04,040
Of course I understand.

557
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:06,480
It's just...

558
00:34:07,040 --> 00:34:09,000
do you truly not want to marry him?

559
00:34:11,680 --> 00:34:13,640
All right. I won't say any more.

560
00:34:13,720 --> 00:34:15,600
Let's not talk about
things that trouble you.

561
00:34:15,680 --> 00:34:17,520
Today, let's just...

562
00:34:17,600 --> 00:34:18,640
relax and enjoy ourselves.

563
00:34:30,080 --> 00:34:31,280
Mengmeng.

564
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:33,320
When did you get that mark on your body?

565
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:34,680
What mark?

566
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:36,280
It looks like a bird.

567
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:37,560
A red one.

568
00:34:37,640 --> 00:34:39,440
A red bird?

569
00:34:51,680 --> 00:34:53,480
This mark on your back

570
00:34:53,560 --> 00:34:54,920
is rather unusual.

571
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,120
Which mark do you mean, Your Majesty?

572
00:34:56,200 --> 00:34:57,360
This drawing.

573
00:34:57,440 --> 00:34:58,520
Do you recognize it?

574
00:35:04,200 --> 00:35:05,040
Yao'er.

575
00:35:06,120 --> 00:35:07,760
Brother Shangguan.

576
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:12,720
That's my father's Black Bird.

577
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:15,520
It's the most powerful divine bird of all.

578
00:35:15,600 --> 00:35:18,240
Brother, draw one for me too.

579
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:21,200
Draw one even bigger than the Black Bird.

580
00:35:21,920 --> 00:35:22,880
No.

581
00:35:22,960 --> 00:35:24,400
My husband has to draw mine first.

582
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:26,880
Draw my Black Bird in red.

583
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:28,920
My brother won't draw one for you.

584
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:30,560
-My brother is mine!
-No, he isn't!

585
00:35:30,640 --> 00:35:31,920
My father said

586
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:32,960
Brother Shangguan

587
00:35:33,040 --> 00:35:34,320
will be my husband someday.

588
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:36,360
-Brother Shangguan is mine!
-He's mine!

589
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:39,200
Yao'er, quickly!

590
00:35:43,280 --> 00:35:44,880
Someone's over there. After them!

591
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:47,880
Are you all right?

592
00:35:48,360 --> 00:35:50,320
Brother Shangguan.

593
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:52,320
-Your hand...
-Keep your voice down.

594
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,840
Where's little Xixia?

595
00:35:54,720 --> 00:35:56,120
She died in your place.

596
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:02,680
Yao'er, remember this.

597
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,000
You must live.

598
00:36:04,080 --> 00:36:06,240
Forget today. Forget who you are.

599
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:08,880
Retreat! Quickly!

600
00:36:10,520 --> 00:36:13,280
Brother Shangguan!

601
00:36:40,080 --> 00:36:41,120
What happened?

602
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:54,200
What's wrong?

603
00:36:55,280 --> 00:36:56,200
Your Majesty.

604
00:36:57,040 --> 00:36:58,720
Let's marry.

605
00:37:12,440 --> 00:37:14,080
Have you thought this through?

606
00:37:14,800 --> 00:37:16,160
I don't want you to force yourself.

607
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:45,840
By Heaven's mandate,

608
00:37:45,920 --> 00:37:47,280
I rule all under Heaven.

609
00:37:47,360 --> 00:37:48,680
Meng Tinghui of the Meng clan

610
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:50,360
is valiant and virtuous,

611
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:51,560
possessing noble character

612
00:37:51,640 --> 00:37:53,160
and truly fit to embody
the virtues of an Empress.

613
00:37:53,240 --> 00:37:55,000
I hereby invest her as Empress,

614
00:37:55,080 --> 00:37:56,160
to serve as mother of the realm.

615
00:37:56,240 --> 00:37:58,680
The proper offices shall choose an
auspicious day and prepare the Six Rites.

616
00:37:58,760 --> 00:38:00,880
I shall personally ride forth
in the imperial carriage

617
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:01,880
to welcome her into the Central Palace.

618
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:04,120
Let this decree be carried out.

619
00:38:26,080 --> 00:38:26,920
Yin Qing.

620
00:38:43,120 --> 00:38:44,320
Three years...

621
00:38:45,880 --> 00:38:47,360
and I never once noticed

622
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:49,040
the scar on your hand.

623
00:38:55,680 --> 00:38:57,720
You devoted yourself
entirely to punishing evil.

624
00:38:58,480 --> 00:39:00,440
Why would you notice such a small detail?

625
00:39:00,520 --> 00:39:01,800
But

626
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:04,560
everything has its proper time.

627
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:08,320
Seeing it now is not too late.

628
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:11,160
Some choices could have...

629
00:39:11,240 --> 00:39:12,520
Some choices,

630
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:14,680
once I've made them,

631
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,640
I never turn back.

632
00:39:20,840 --> 00:39:22,640
This newly compiled Records of the Realm

633
00:39:22,720 --> 00:39:23,880
states in its third chapter

634
00:39:23,960 --> 00:39:26,120
that after the waterworks in Daning's
seven prefectures were completed,

635
00:39:26,200 --> 00:39:28,240
grain output rose by thirty percent.

636
00:39:29,640 --> 00:39:30,760
Have you read it?

637
00:39:33,280 --> 00:39:35,280
I only wonder whether that extra grain

638
00:39:36,560 --> 00:39:38,360
can fill the bellies of those

639
00:39:38,440 --> 00:39:40,640
forced to dig the canals
and build the dikes.

640
00:39:41,520 --> 00:39:43,120
Beneath prosperity,

641
00:39:43,200 --> 00:39:44,280
there are always shadows.

642
00:39:46,680 --> 00:39:48,080
These past years, Daning

643
00:39:48,160 --> 00:39:49,560
has indeed been peaceful and prosperous.

644
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:54,160
Peaceful and prosperous?

645
00:39:55,120 --> 00:39:56,720
Beneath the scent of ink,

646
00:39:56,800 --> 00:39:58,480
how much blood and how
many tears are hidden?

647
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:00,840
This peace written on paper...

648
00:40:01,680 --> 00:40:03,280
how many bones lie cold beneath it?

649
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,160
I live in Daning.

650
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,080
As one of its people,

651
00:40:11,680 --> 00:40:13,640
I have watched Daning grow
more prosperous each day,

652
00:40:13,720 --> 00:40:14,840
the state wealthy and its people strong.

653
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:16,280
And as an official,

654
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:18,680
I've watched His Majesty
labor from dawn until night

655
00:40:18,760 --> 00:40:20,440
so his people may live and work in peace.

656
00:40:20,520 --> 00:40:22,480
The peace we seek

657
00:40:23,240 --> 00:40:24,640
is not far away.

658
00:40:24,720 --> 00:40:27,160
And what of those who
won't live to see it?

659
00:40:40,040 --> 00:40:40,880
I believe

660
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:44,280
the rain will soon pass
and the skies will clear.

661
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:45,880
The Rain Bell

662
00:40:46,840 --> 00:40:48,400
was made to create illusions.

663
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:50,000
You've stared at it for so long

664
00:40:50,720 --> 00:40:51,560
that you've forgotten

665
00:40:51,640 --> 00:40:53,440
the rain never stopped.

666
00:40:59,200 --> 00:41:02,280
Even this rainbow is false.

667
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:43,520
Mengmeng.

668
00:41:49,240 --> 00:41:50,280
Our Director Meng, who wouldn't blink

669
00:41:50,360 --> 00:41:52,120
even if Mount Tai collapsed before her,

670
00:41:52,200 --> 00:41:54,080
can actually get so
nervous her hands shake.

671
00:41:54,960 --> 00:41:56,760
You are marrying the Emperor of Daning.

672
00:41:56,840 --> 00:41:58,440
I wouldn't believe you if
you said you weren't nervous.

673
00:42:01,440 --> 00:42:03,840
Come. Tonight, we don't
stop until we're drunk.

674
00:42:04,800 --> 00:42:05,640
Cheers!

675
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:21,360
-Cheers!
-Come on.
